      }
    ],
    "slug": "masters-whip",
    "description": "<p>If the user hits an Ally with an @Trait[impel] Attack, the user can spend @PP[-2] as a Free Action at @Trait[interrupt-3] and @Trait[flinch-20] to cause that creature to be @Affliction[advance 50], and have a 30% chance of being afflicted with @Affliction[bleed 2].</p><p>The user deals 30% more damage and has +40% EHR with their @Trait[impel] Attacks, and their @Trait[basic] Attacks gain the @Trait[impel] Trait.</p>",
